{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/77493-like-i-built-it-question","id":77493,"title":"\"Like I built it\" question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-02-22T23:21:43-08:00","id":77493,"title":"\"Like I built it\" question","content":"In the discriprion of the embed it says if shouldn't be used on natural objects. My question is that since Demons were crafted by the G-M, couldn't their demonic form be considered for use with this embed or would you see the form as &quot;natural&quot; to the demon. NOTE: I would only consider form abilities like &quot;Claws and Fangs&quot; &quot;horns&quot; &quot;sword arm&quot; &quot;rivit arm&quot; ect...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1991-fallenxanderel","name":"FallenXanderel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-23T06:13:41-08:00","id":77617,"title":"","content":"Well, I don't see why not. Seems thematic enough","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-23T10:34:49-08:00","id":77717,"title":"","content":"While I disagree with the position that since demons are crafted by the G-M this power should function on them. I find myself agreeing with the proposition that this power could work on demon form abilities that have a tool/object equivalent within the rules (like rivet gun, sword arm, etc)... though I suppose the failure and dramatic failure options could be more severe in those instances.<br /> <br /> If you were a player in my game I'd let it happen but with the caveat that this is an exception and NOT a re-interpretation of the embed to include demonic form abilities in general... and then I'd suggest that dramatic failure on the embed used in this exceptional way would inflict bashing or lethal damage on the demon equal to the demon's primum <br /> <br /> As per usual: Your mileage may vary, consider your gaming group, the ST has final say, etc., etc.,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1930,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1930-rixx","user":"Rixx","date":". 02-23-2014, 01:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1930-rixx","name":"Rixx","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1930_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T11:42:22-08:00","id":78471,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenXanderel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/77493-like-i-built-it-question#post77493\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In the discriprion of the embed it says if shouldn't be used on natural objects. My question is that since Demons were crafted by the G-M, couldn't their demonic form be considered for use with this embed or would you see the form as &quot;natural&quot; to the demon. NOTE: I would only consider form abilities like &quot;Claws and Fangs&quot; &quot;horns&quot; &quot;sword arm&quot; &quot;rivit arm&quot; ect...</div> </div> </div> </div>That's kind of a cool idea, actually. I can see that becoming really dangerous as your Primum gets higher, but hey, I'm all for slinging around handfuls of dice.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}